## 📦 Third-Party Dependencies

This project integrates the following open-source libraries:

### 🔢 Giac
- **License**: GNU General Public License v3.0
- **Source**: [https://www-fourier.ujf-grenoble.fr/~parisse/giac.html](https://www-fourier.ujf-grenoble.fr/~parisse/giac.html)
- **Usage**: Symbolic computation engine for algebraic and calculus operations.

### 🧮 SymEngine
- **License**: MIT License
- **Source**: [https://github.com/symengine/symengine](https://github.com/symengine/symengine)
- **Usage**: Fast symbolic math engine used for lightweight symbolic manipulation.

### 🧠 llama.cpp
- **License**: MIT License
- **Source**: [https://github.com/ggerganov/llama.cpp](https://github.com/ggerganov/llama.cpp)
- **Usage**: Local LLM inference engine for AI-assisted symbolic reasoning and explanation.

All dependencies are used in accordance with their respective licenses.  
MIT-licensed components are compatible with GPL-3.0 and do not impose additional restrictions.